# Demo requests (VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client, or copy into Postman).
# Start the server first: python manage.py runserver

@base = http://localhost:8000/api

### Health: is the ORS key configured?
GET {{base}}/health/

### Short route (< 500 mi): one fuel stop
POST {{base}}/route/
Content-Type: application/json

{"start": "Dallas, TX", "finish": "Houston, TX"}

### Cross-country route: several fuel stops (send twice: the second is a cache hit)
POST {{base}}/route/
Content-Type: application/json

{"start": "Chicago, IL", "finish": "Los Angeles, CA"}

### Same route with the optional $5 stop penalty: fewer, larger stops
POST {{base}}/route/
Content-Type: application/json

{"start": "Chicago, IL", "finish": "Los Angeles, CA", "stop_penalty": 5}

### Invalid: outside the USA (400)
POST {{base}}/route/
Content-Type: application/json

{"start": "Toronto, ON", "finish": "Chicago, IL"}

### Map page (open in a browser)
GET {{base}}/route/map/?start=Chicago, IL&finish=Los Angeles, CA
